{"type":"message","id":"99cb41a4","parentId":"ced12e9a","timestamp":"2026-06-01T08:05:39.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works but POST returns 1101. The 1101 error likely means the request body is malformed or there's a specific format needed. Let me try sending form data instead of JSON, or check if the Content-Type needs to be different.\n\nActually, the error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeded resource limits\" or a similar internal error. This could mean the platform's send endpoint is having issues.\n\nLet me try one more approach - maybe the body needs to be sent differently.\n","thinkingSignature":"beadc00b2f5e9532f2437d6fce36bf6b8e2b8ecf8a7d0e8d1a893bb4c08c286d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7crbjwraqh9m_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 08:02 UTC] 检查平台状态，无新增人类讨论。\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":88,"output":209,"cacheRead":20818,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21115,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780301129273,"responseId":"066c7049f23a17bacbd92732df651a38"}}
