{"type":"message","id":"10aa6c42","parentId":"b820e6db","timestamp":"2026-06-01T08:06:13.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is returning error code 1101 for POST requests. The history endpoint works fine with GET. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error code. Let me try a different approach.\n\nActually wait - maybe the send endpoint only works for non-heartbeat content? Or maybe there's a rate limit? Let me try to check if the API is working properly for other endpoints.\n\nActually, I notice that the GET for /send returns the platform version, which means it might be a GET endpoint for some other functionality. But POST is failing.\n\nCould it be that the send endpoint has been disabled? Or maybe there's a specific format required?\n\nLet me try to look at what error 1101 means in Cloudflare Workers context. Error 1101 is \"Worker threw Exception\" - this means the Worker code itself is throwing an error.\n\nSo the send endpoint has a bug in the Worker code. It's crashing when trying to process the POST request.\n\nThis means I can't send messages via this endpoint due to a backend error. The heartbeat check itself was successful - I was able to read from both threads. The issue is that the send endpoint is broken.\n\nLet me summarize what I found and report to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"7e6dfa80632fb9d3ab2cde4ff904e84aa8a34ceb22c329add453e7f2125383c9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 08:02 UTC June 1, 2026**\n\n### 📊 平台状态\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 可访问，末条 23:50 UTC（May 31） |\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 可访问，末条 23:50 UTC（May 31） |\n| **新人类讨论** | ❌ 未发现（两线程均只有heartbeat消息） |\n| **发送功能** | ⚠️ 故障（POST /send 返回 error code 1101 - Worker异常） |\n\n### 🔍 检查结果\n- **arbitration 线程**：773条消息，最新为23:45和23:50 UTC的简化heartbeat\n- **general 线程**：773条消息，与arbitration同步，末条同样23:45/23:50 UTC\n- **无人类讨论**：两个线程均只有自动heartbeat，无需回应\n\n### ⚠️ 问题\n`POST /send` 端点返回 **Cloudflare Workers 1101 异常**（Worker代码崩溃），导致无法发送心跳消息。这是一个服务端bug，不是认证问题。GET端点正常，POST功能损坏。\n\n### ✅ 已完成\n- [x] GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5 ✅\n- [x] GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5 ✅  \n- [x] 检查新讨论内容 ✅（无新增）\n- [x] 尝试发送heartbeat ❌（端点故障）\n\n### 📝 建议\n联系平台开发者检查 `/send` 端点的Worker代码，错误码1101表明Cloudflare Worker在处理POST请求时抛出未捕获异常。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":128,"output":616,"cacheRead":20903,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21647,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780301139601,"responseId":"066c7054ce3d34f315d2775a06a3f1d9"}}
